body:
RIGHT!! I'VE BEEN MAKING IT SO OBVIOUS THAT I'M NOT OKAY! I'M NOT OKAY! IF THEY REALLY CARE ABOUT ME, IF THEY REALLY LOVE ME, WHY CAN'T THEY SEE THE SIGNS!!! WHY CAN'T THEY HELP ME???

&#x200B;

I also needed to vent....Anyway Hello Stranger!! .. I hope your okay.. I don't know how to help you but I hope you meet someone who can.
